SoftGRE source packaging
========================

The source package uses format 3.0 (quilt), Autotools and debhelper level 13.
Build dependencies are declared in debian/control. Debhelper runs autoreconf,
compiles the daemon and executes the C regression suite before packaging.

    ./autogen.sh
    make deb

The build installs configuration under /etc/softgred, uses /run for the PID
and includes the Python/PHP frontend with --enable-web. Both systemd units
are enabled and startup is requested on systemd hosts during installation. Documentation retains its
relative paths and Markdown/assets remain uncompressed for local navigation.

Dockerfiles are in docker/ and use the repository root as build context.
For distribution-specific packages, select a matching BASE with
docker/Dockerfile.release, then run scripts/build-deb.sh for debian12,
debian13, ubuntu22.04 or ubuntu24.04. The script adds the distribution suffix
to the Debian version installs and validates the generated deb, then copies it to the output path.

The upstream version is in VERSION. Use ./bump.sh --check to validate it and
./bump.sh patch, minor, major or X.Y.Z to update it with the Debian changelog.
